# Local AI-platform install footprints (created by `npx dev-workflow init`
# in this repo when used as a self-host harness during development).
# Each user's local setup; not part of the dev-workflow source.
#
# .dw/ belongs to this list for the same reason, with one extra: in a CONSUMER
# project .dw/ is meant to be committed, but here it is the harness auditing its
# own source, so it collects run artifacts (secure-audit reports, metrics, spec
# drafts) that are local evidence rather than shipped source. The scaffold that
# generates .dw/ lives in scaffold/ and IS tracked.
.claude/
.codex/
.agents/
.opencode/
.dw/
skills-lock.json

# .github/ is a local generated footprint (Copilot/agent wrappers) EXCEPT the
# committed CI workflow, which is source. Ignore everything under .github/ but
# keep .github/workflows/ci.yml tracked; generated agents stay ignored.
.github/*
!.github/workflows/
.github/workflows/*
!.github/workflows/ci.yml

# Node
node_modules/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
